Z||000003||Ryan Wright||08-25-2001||11:12 PM||||Well, the stock grille cloth had some stains on it and needed to be replaced anyway. The grilles on my totalled '85 are in perfect condition so I figured I'd put the red on the front and if I didn't like it, I could just put my '85 grilles in and it would still look better than it did. It came out so good I did the back grilles to match.<P>Next, I want to make some new floor mats. Plush red with black "Fiero" lettering. I don't want to make any major/unchangable modifications, so most of the car will stay stock, but I think the new floor mats will help balance out the speaker grilles.<BR><P>------------------<BR>-Ryan Wright (http://www.ryanwright.com)||||reg||1
